; Fur core — signals, vdom, SSR, head, data, router, reconciler. Pure + abstract
; (.mli is the contract + recompile firewall). Platform ops are a virtual library.
; fennec.pulse.sift is here ONLY for Data.model (the typed resource: Sift.decode_json a seed) —
; the one place the isomorphic data layer speaks the shared model. Sift is bson-only + jsoo-safe and
; is already linked into every client bundle (collections/codecs/handler payloads), so this adds NO
; bytes to a real bundle; it is the natural home for Data.model since `Data` (this module) is what
; `open Fur` binds in userland.

(library
 (name fennec_fur)
 (public_name fennec.fur)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries fennec.fur.platform fennec.pulse.sift fennec-hunt.unit fennec-hunt.prop)
 (inline_tests
  (backend fennec-hunt.runner))
 (preprocess
  (pps fennec.fur.ppx))
 (modes byte native)
 (flags
  (:standard -w -a)))
